# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Monodomain variant: monodomainSolver + monodomain1DSolver.
#
# The probe reads -1 through t=0.025 and activates at 28.6 ms; sampled at
# endTime. The Purkinje tree conducts at ~3.3 m/s, the hybrid variant's
# calibrated Purkinje velocity, so the monodomain and hybrid probes activate
# about 0.3 ms apart.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  0.04   2  0.0286309    1e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.025  5  0.00270588661  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   3  0.00331333526  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   7  0.00409203593  2e-4
